1272		\[
1273			L(x) = \sum_{j=1}^m L^{(j)}(x^{(j)})
1274		\]
1275		for all $x = \sum_{j=1}^m x^{(j)} \in \bigoplus_{j=1}^m V^{(j)}$, is an $\ell$-level CL function on $V$ for $\ell = \max_j \{\ell_j\}$; the maximum exists since $m \ge 1$.
